#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:5
msgid "Billing a residence"
msgstr "Facturer une résidence"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:8
msgid ""
"Bill a serviced residence every month: the contract's price in parts, the "
"deposit, the residents in the month's billing period, adjustments, credit "
"notes and the services included in the price."
msgstr ""
"Facturer une résidence-services chaque mois : le prix du contrat en "
"composantes, la garantie, les habitants dans la période de facturation du "
"mois, les ajustements, les notes de crédit et les services inclus dans le "
"prix."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:12
msgid "Where is a residence billed?"
msgstr "Où une résidence est-elle facturée ?"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:13
msgid ""
"In the same monthly billing period as the rest of the house: **Billing → "
"Facturation → Billing Periods**, then **Generate**. Each contract adds its "
"lines for the residents of the residence."
msgstr ""
"Dans la même période de facturation mensuelle que le reste de la maison : "
"**Facturation → Facturation → Périodes de facturation**, puis **Générer**. "
"Chaque contrat ajoute ses lignes pour les habitants de la résidence."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:15
msgid "Is the rent reduced when the resident is away?"
msgstr "Le loyer est-il réduit quand l'habitant est absent ?"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:16
msgid ""
"No. The price does not depend on the days spent at home: a residence records"
" no absence."
msgstr ""
"Non. Le prix ne dépend pas des jours passés chez soi : une résidence "
"n'enregistre aucune absence."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:18
msgid "A price was corrected after the month was invoiced. What happens?"
msgstr ""
"Un prix a été corrigé après la facturation du mois. Que se passe-t-il ?"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:19
msgid ""
"At the next generation, the difference lands on its own adjustment line. "
"When a month only gives money back, its invoice becomes a credit note."
msgstr ""
"À la génération suivante, la différence arrive sur sa propre ligne "
"d'ajustement. Quand un mois ne fait que rembourser, sa facture devient une "
"note de crédit."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:21
msgid "Why is a contract billing nothing?"
msgstr "Pourquoi un contrat ne facture-t-il rien ?"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:22
msgid ""
"It has no price. The contract shows *This contract has no price: it bills "
"nothing*, the period's chatter names it after the generation, and the "
"billing dashboard counts it."
msgstr ""
"Il n'a pas de prix. Le contrat affiche *Ce contrat n'a pas de prix : il ne "
"facture rien*, le chatter de la période le nomme après la génération, et le "
"tableau de bord de la facturation le compte."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:24
msgid "Why is a service not billed?"
msgstr "Pourquoi un service n'est-il pas facturé ?"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:25
msgid ""
"It is listed in **Included in the price** on the residence: the price "
"already covers it, so it is never billed on top. The period's chatter names "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Il figure dans **Inclus dans le prix** sur la résidence : le prix le couvre "
"déjà, il n'est donc jamais facturé en plus. Le chatter de la période le "
"nomme."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:27
msgid "Does the contract fix the VAT?"
msgstr "Le contrat fixe-t-il la TVA ?"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:28
msgid ""
"No. Each part of the price has a product, and the product carries the VAT "
"and the income account. Set the VAT on the products with your accountant."
msgstr ""
"Non. Chaque composante du prix a un produit, et c'est le produit qui porte "
"la TVA et le compte de produits. Réglez la TVA sur les produits avec votre "
"comptable."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:31
msgid ""
"A residence bills from its **contracts**: no daily rate, no care allowance, "
"an ordinary invoice to the resident every month. The residents of the "
"residence join the **same billing period** as the rest of the house; see "
"[Billing a month, step by step](../facturation/facturer-un-mois.md) for the "
"period itself."
msgstr ""
"Une résidence facture à partir de ses **contrats** : pas de prix journalier,"
" pas de forfait de soins, une facture ordinaire à l'habitant chaque mois. "
"Les habitants de la résidence rejoignent la **même période de facturation** "
"que le reste de la maison ; voir [Facturer un mois, pas à "
"pas](../facturation/facturer-un-mois.md) pour la période elle-même."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:37
msgid "The price of a contract"
msgstr "Le prix d'un contrat"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:39
msgid "The **Price** tab of the contract lists the **parts of the price**:"
msgstr "L'onglet **Prix** du contrat liste les **composantes du prix** :"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid "Column"
msgstr "Colonne"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Utilité"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid "**Component**"
msgstr "**Composante**"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid "**Rent**, **Charges**, **Common services** or **Care share**."
msgstr "**Loyer**, **Charges**, **Services communs** ou **Part de soins**."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid "**Product**"
msgstr "**Produit**"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid ""
"Proposed from the component. It carries the VAT and the income account of "
"this part."
msgstr ""
"Proposé d'après la composante. Il porte la TVA et le compte de produits de "
"cette composante."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid "**Amount**"
msgstr "**Montant**"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid "The amount of this part."
msgstr "Le montant de cette composante."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid "**Basis**"
msgstr "**Base**"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid "**Per month** or **Per day**, proposed from the regime."
msgstr "**Par mois** ou **Par jour**, proposé d'après le régime."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid "**From** / **Until**"
msgstr "**Du** / **Jusqu'au**"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:11
msgid ""
"When this part applies. Empty: from the start, or until the end, of the "
"contract."
msgstr ""
"Quand cette composante s'applique. Vide : depuis le début, ou jusqu'à la "
"fin, du contrat."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:49
msgid ""
"**Price per month** adds up the parts running today. The contracts list "
"shows it too."
msgstr ""
"**Prix par mois** additionne les composantes en cours aujourd'hui. La liste "
"des contrats l'affiche aussi."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:52
msgid ""
"An **Owner-occupier** contract is never billed its **Rent**: the occupant "
"pays for the services only."
msgstr ""
"Un contrat **Propriétaire occupant** n'est jamais facturé de son **Loyer** :"
" l'occupant ne paie que les services."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:54
msgid ""
"A new contract on a unit starts from the last price of that unit, to read "
"and adjust before signing."
msgstr ""
"Un nouveau contrat sur un logement part du dernier prix de ce logement, à "
"relire et ajuster avant de signer."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:56
msgid ""
"To raise or lower the price of a running contract, use **Change the price**,"
" which keeps past months at their price — see [Changing the "
"price](changement-prix.md)."
msgstr ""
"Pour augmenter ou baisser le prix d'un contrat en cours, utilisez **Changer "
"le prix**, qui garde les mois passés à leur prix — voir [Changer le "
"prix](changement-prix.md)."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:62
msgid "The deposit"
msgstr "La garantie"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:64
msgid "The **Deposit** group of the **Price** tab keeps:"
msgstr "Le groupe **Garantie** de l'onglet **Prix** garde :"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:66
msgid "**Deposit expected** — what the regime asks for, at the current price;"
msgstr "**Garantie attendue** — ce que demande le régime, au prix actuel ;"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:67
msgid "**Deposit received** and **Received on**;"
msgstr "**Garantie reçue** et **Reçu le** ;"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:68
msgid "**Deposit account** — the individual account the deposit is kept on;"
msgstr ""
"**Compte de garantie** — le compte individuel sur lequel la garantie est "
"placée ;"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:69
msgid "**Returned on**."
msgstr "**Restituée le**."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:71
msgid ""
"The contract warns when the deposit received is above what the regime "
"allows."
msgstr ""
"Le contrat avertit quand la garantie reçue dépasse ce que le régime permet."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:73
msgid "Billed from"
msgstr "Facturé à partir du"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:75
msgid ""
"**Billed from**, in the contract's dates, is the first day billed by the "
"application — the entry date by default. Move it forward when earlier months"
" were billed elsewhere, for example before the residence started with the "
"application."
msgstr ""
"**Facturé à partir du**, dans les dates du contrat, est le premier jour "
"facturé par l'application — la date d'entrée par défaut. Avancez-le quand "
"des mois antérieurs ont été facturés ailleurs, par exemple avant que la "
"résidence ne démarre avec l'application."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:80
msgid "The residence's own settings"
msgstr "Les réglages propres de la résidence"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:82
msgid "On the residence (**Serviced Living → Configuration → Residences**):"
msgstr ""
"Sur la résidence (**Résidence-services → Configuration → Résidences**) :"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:84
msgid ""
"**Invoice journal** — numbers this residence's invoices apart. Empty, they "
"use the company's resident journal."
msgstr ""
"**Journal de facturation** — numérote à part les factures de cette "
"résidence. Vide, elles utilisent le journal habitants de la société."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:86
msgid ""
"**Included in the price** — the services the price already covers. A "
"supplement, a service request or a meal on one of these products is never "
"billed on top."
msgstr ""
"**Inclus dans le prix** — les services que le prix couvre déjà. Un "
"supplément, une demande de service ou un repas sur l'un de ces produits "
"n'est jamais facturé en plus."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:90
msgid "Billing the month"
msgstr "Facturer le mois"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:92
msgid ""
"Open the month's period in **Billing → Facturation → Billing Periods**."
msgstr ""
"Ouvrez la période du mois dans **Facturation → Facturation → Périodes de "
"facturation**."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:93
msgid "Click **Generate**, as for any month."
msgstr "Cliquez sur **Générer**, comme pour tout mois."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:94
msgid ""
"In the **Residents** tab, the residents of the residence show beside the "
"others, with their **Unit** and their **Contract**, and without presence or "
"absence days."
msgstr ""
"Dans l'onglet **Habitants**, les habitants de la résidence apparaissent à "
"côté des autres, avec leur **Logement** et leur **Contrat**, et sans jours "
"de présence ou d'absence."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:97
msgid "Create and confirm the invoices as usual."
msgstr "Créez et confirmez les factures comme d'habitude."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:99
msgid "For each contract, the generation bills:"
msgstr "Pour chaque contrat, la génération facture :"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:101
msgid "one line per part of the price, on the person **Invoiced to**;"
msgstr ""
"une ligne par composante du prix, à la personne indiquée dans **Facturé à** "
";"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:102
msgid "the supplements of each occupant, on every day spent in the unit;"
msgstr ""
"les suppléments de chaque occupant, pour chaque jour passé dans le logement "
";"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:103
msgid ""
"the meals taken at the residence, when they are billed — see [Meals in a "
"residence](repas.md);"
msgstr ""
"les repas pris à la résidence, quand ils sont facturés — voir [Les repas en "
"résidence](repas.md) ;"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:105
msgid "the service requests done — see [Service requests](demandes.md)."
msgstr ""
"les demandes de service faites — voir [Demandes de service](demandes.md)."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:107
msgid ""
"A second occupant only shows in the period when they have something of their"
" own to pay. A contract's lines follow the contract: to change a price, "
"change it on the contract, not on the period."
msgstr ""
"Un second occupant n'apparaît dans la période que s'il a quelque chose à "
"payer lui-même. Les lignes d'un contrat suivent le contrat : pour changer un"
" prix, changez-le sur le contrat, pas sur la période."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:111
msgid "How an incomplete month is billed"
msgstr "Comment un mois incomplet est facturé"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:113
msgid "The regime decides:"
msgstr "Le régime décide :"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:115
msgid "**First month pro rata** — the month of entry is billed by the day;"
msgstr "**Premier mois au prorata** — le mois d'entrée est facturé au jour ;"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:116
msgid "**Month started is due** — the month of departure is billed in full;"
msgstr "**Mois entamé dû** — le mois du départ est facturé en entier ;"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:117
msgid ""
"a price that changes during a month is billed by the day on each side of the"
" change."
msgstr ""
"un prix qui change en cours de mois est facturé au jour de chaque côté du "
"changement."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:120
msgid "Corrections, adjustments and credit notes"
msgstr "Corrections, ajustements et notes de crédit"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:122
msgid ""
"Every generation compares, month by month, what is **due** with what was "
"already **billed**. An entry recorded late, a release, a notice that ends "
"early or a price corrected afterwards each lands on one **Adjustment** line "
"for the difference. Generating again gives the same answer."
msgstr ""
"Chaque génération compare, mois par mois, ce qui est **dû** avec ce qui a "
"déjà été **facturé**. Une entrée enregistrée en retard, une libération, un "
"préavis qui se termine plus tôt ou un prix corrigé après coup arrive chacun "
"sur une ligne **Ajustement** pour la différence. Générer à nouveau donne la "
"même réponse."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:127
msgid "When a month only gives money back, its invoice is a **credit note**."
msgstr ""
"Quand un mois ne fait que rembourser, sa facture est une **note de crédit**."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:129
msgid "Services on a separate invoice"
msgstr "Services sur une facture distincte"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:131
msgid ""
"When the regime ticks **Services on a separate invoice**, the optional "
"services (supplements, meals, service requests) go on an invoice of their "
"own, and the contract's price stays on the ordinary one."
msgstr ""
"Quand le régime coche **Services sur une facture distincte**, les services "
"optionnels (suppléments, repas, demandes de service) vont sur une facture à "
"part, et le prix du contrat reste sur la facture ordinaire."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:135
msgid "What the period tells you"
msgstr "Ce que la période vous dit"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:137
msgid "After the generation, the period's chatter names:"
msgstr "Après la génération, le chatter de la période nomme :"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:139
msgid "the contracts without a price, which billed nothing;"
msgstr "les contrats sans prix, qui n'ont rien facturé ;"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:140
msgid "the services included in the price, which were not billed;"
msgstr "les services inclus dans le prix, qui n'ont pas été facturés ;"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:141
msgid ""
"the contracts billed for several months at once — move **Billed from** "
"forward if those months were billed elsewhere, then generate again."
msgstr ""
"les contrats facturés pour plusieurs mois d'un coup — avancez **Facturé à "
"partir du** si ces mois ont été facturés ailleurs, puis générez à nouveau."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:144
msgid "The billing dashboard"
msgstr "Le tableau de bord de la facturation"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:146
msgid ""
"When the house has a residence, **Billing → Dashboard** adds a **Serviced "
"living** lane:"
msgstr ""
"Quand la maison a une résidence, **Facturation → Tableau de bord** ajoute "
"une colonne **Résidence-services** :"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:149
msgid "**Running contracts** — the units billed this month;"
msgstr "**Contrats en cours** — les logements facturés ce mois-ci ;"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:150
msgid "**Contracts without a price** — running and billing nothing;"
msgstr "**Contrats sans prix** — en cours et ne facturant rien ;"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:151
msgid "**Units to release** — nobody lives there, still billed."
msgstr "**Logements à libérer** — plus personne n'y vit, toujours facturés."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:153
msgid "Each figure opens the contracts it counts."
msgstr "Chaque chiffre ouvre les contrats qu'il compte."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:155
msgid "In Belgium"
msgstr "En Belgique"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:158
msgid ""
"A resident of a residence never enters the insurer's billing: no dependency "
"category, no insurer share, no electronic invoicing. See [Serviced "
"residences in Belgium](../belgique/residences-services.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un habitant d'une résidence n'entre jamais dans la facturation à l'organisme"
" assureur : pas de catégorie de dépendance, pas de part assureur, pas de "
"facturation électronique. Voir [Les résidences-services en "
"Belgique](../belgique/residences-services.md)."

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:163
msgid "Going further"
msgstr "Pour aller plus loin"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:165
msgid "[Changing the price](changement-prix.md)"
msgstr "[Changer le prix](changement-prix.md)"

#: ../../content/residences-services/facturation.md:166
msgid "[Notice and release of a unit](preavis-liberation.md)"
msgstr "[Préavis et libération d'un logement](preavis-liberation.md)"

